       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLCKY17.
      * CKYCR SEND QUEUE - SEVEN DAY LIMIT
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RUN-COUNT              PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-DAYS-HELD              PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-QUEUE                  PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-DAYS-HELD
           PERFORM 2000-QUEUE
           DISPLAY 'QUEUE: ' WS-QUEUE
           STOP RUN.
       2000-QUEUE.
      * DAYS-HELD: DAYS SINCE THE CUSTOMER'S UPDATE WAS RECEIVED.
           MOVE 'NORMAL' TO WS-QUEUE
           IF WS-DAYS-HELD > 7
              MOVE 'LATE' TO WS-QUEUE
           END-IF
           ADD 1 TO WS-RUN-COUNT.
